  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.About" xml:space="preserve">Tungkol sa Kiriha</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.About.Body" xml:space="preserve">Pinagsasama ng Kiriha sa iisang window ang pamamahala ng file ng Windows Explorer at ang mga tab, address bar at bookmark ng Chrome. Nase-save ang mga setting para sa kasalukuyang user.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Acrylic" xml:space="preserve">Gamitin ang acrylic effect (malabong translucent) sa window</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.DefaultFolderApp" xml:space="preserve">Gawing default na app ang Kiriha sa pagbukas ng mga folder at drive</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.DefaultFolderApp.Off" xml:space="preserve">Kapag naka-on, tumatakbo ang Kiriha tuwing bubuksan ang folder o drive mula sa File Explorer.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.DefaultFolderApp.On" xml:space="preserve">Sa kasalukuyan, bumubukas sa Kiriha ang mga folder at drive. Kapag ini-off ito, babalik ang dating gawi.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.DefaultView" xml:space="preserve">Default na view ng folder</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.DefaultView.Mode" xml:space="preserve">View</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.DefaultView.Note" xml:space="preserve">Ang mga folder na walang naka-save na view ay bubuksan gamit ang mga setting na ito. Kapag binago mo ang view o pagkakasunod-sunod sa loob ng isang folder, para lang sa folder na iyon ito naitatago.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.DefaultView.Reset" xml:space="preserve">I-reset ang mga view kada folder</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.DefaultView.ResetDone" xml:space="preserve">Nabura ang mga naka-save na view kada folder.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.DefaultView.ResetNote" xml:space="preserve">Buburahin ang view, pagkakasunod-sunod at lapad ng column na naaalala sa bawat folder, at babalik sa mga default sa itaas.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.DefaultView.Sort" xml:space="preserve">Pag-uri-uriin ayon sa</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Display" xml:space="preserve">Hitsura</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Display.Subtitle" xml:space="preserve">Iakma ang hitsura ng listahan ng file at ng Kiriha</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Explorer" xml:space="preserve">Listahan ng file</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ExplorerContextMenu" xml:space="preserve">Idagdag ang “Buksan gamit ang Kiriha” sa context menu ng File Explorer</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ExplorerContextMenuNote" xml:space="preserve">Nagbibigay-daan na buksan sa Kiriha ang folder sa pamamagitan ng right click sa folder o sa background nito.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.FolderTree" xml:space="preserve">Tree ng folder</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.IconSet.Material" xml:space="preserve">Material Icon Theme</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.IconSet.Note" xml:space="preserve">Gumagamit ang Material Icon Theme ng material-icon-theme (MIT License, © Material Extensions). Ipinapakita ng Windows set ang parehong shell icon ng File Explorer.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.IconSet.Original" xml:space="preserve">Orihinal na mga icon ng Kiriha</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.IconSet.Windows" xml:space="preserve">Mga shell icon ng Windows</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Icons" xml:space="preserve">Mga icon</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Language" xml:space="preserve">Wika ng interface</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Language.Note" xml:space="preserve">Bilang default, kinukuha ang wika mula sa display language ng Windows.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.License" xml:space="preserve">Lisensya</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Maintenance" xml:space="preserve">Pagpapanatili</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Maintenance.Data" xml:space="preserve">Data at cache</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Maintenance.OpenLogFolder" xml:space="preserve">Buksan ang folder ng log</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Maintenance.ReloadQuickAccess" xml:space="preserve">I-reload ang Quick access</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Maintenance.ResetSettings" xml:space="preserve">I-reset ang mga setting</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Maintenance.Subtitle" xml:space="preserve">Pamahalaan ang cache, mga log at data ng setting</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.MinimizeToTray" xml:space="preserve">I-minimize sa notification area</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.MinimizeToTrayNote" xml:space="preserve">Kapag na-minimize, nawawala ang Kiriha sa taskbar at maibabalik mula sa icon nito sa notification area.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Mouse" xml:space="preserve">Mouse</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Mouse.BackgroundDoubleClick" xml:space="preserve">Kapag nag-double click sa background ng folder</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Mouse.BackgroundMiddleClick" xml:space="preserve">Kapag nag-click gamit ang gulong sa background ng folder</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Mouse.CloseTab" xml:space="preserve">Isara ang tab</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Mouse.None" xml:space="preserve">Walang gagawin</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Mouse.Pin" xml:space="preserve">I-pin ang tab</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Mouse.Refresh" xml:space="preserve">I-refresh</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Mouse.TabDoubleClick" xml:space="preserve">Kapag nag-double click sa isang tab</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Mouse.TabMiddleClick" xml:space="preserve">Kapag nag-click gamit ang gulong sa isang tab</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Mouse.Up" xml:space="preserve">Umakyat ng isang antas</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.RunAtStartup" xml:space="preserve">Patakbuhin ang Kiriha kapag nagsimula ang Windows</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.RunAtStartupNote" xml:space="preserve">Awtomatikong tumatakbo ang Kiriha kapag nag-sign in ka.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Shortcuts" xml:space="preserve">Mga shortcut</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Shortcuts.FileOps" xml:space="preserve">Mga operasyon sa file</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Shortcuts.FileOpsBody" xml:space="preserve">Ctrl+X / C / V　I-cut, kopyahin, i-paste　　Delete / Shift+Delete　Tanggalin, tanggalin nang tuluyan&#10;F2　Palitan ang pangalan　　Alt+Enter　Mga katangian　　Ctrl+Shift+N　Bagong folder　　Alt+P　Preview</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Shortcuts.Navigation" xml:space="preserve">Nabigasyon at pagtingin</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Shortcuts.NavigationBody" xml:space="preserve">Ctrl+L / F4　I-edit ang address&#10;Ctrl+F / F3　Maghanap&#10;Alt+← / →　Bumalik at sumulong&#10;Alt+↑　Umakyat ng isang antas&#10;F5　I-refresh / F11　Buong screen</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Shortcuts.Subtitle" xml:space="preserve">Mga keyboard shortcut para mas mabilis magtrabaho</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Shortcuts.Tabs" xml:space="preserve">Mga tab</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Shortcuts.TabsBody" xml:space="preserve">Ctrl+T　Bagong tab&#10;Ctrl+W　Isara ang tab&#10;Ctrl+Shift+T　Buksan ulit ang naisarang tab&#10;Ctrl+Tab　Lumipat ng tab&#10;Ctrl+1..9　Pumili ng partikular na tab</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ShowBookmarksBar" xml:space="preserve">Ipakita ang bookmarks bar (Ctrl+Shift+B)</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ShowCheckBoxes" xml:space="preserve">Ipakita ang mga check box ng item</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ShowExtensions" xml:space="preserve">Ipakita ang mga extension ng file</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ShowHidden" xml:space="preserve">Ipakita ang mga nakatagong file</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.StartMinimizedToTray" xml:space="preserve">Magsimulang naka-minimize sa notification area</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.StartMinimizedToTrayNote" xml:space="preserve">Nagsisimula ang Kiriha nang hindi ipinapakita ang window, naka-minimize sa notification area.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Startup" xml:space="preserve">Pagsisimula</x:String>
